  "title": "Joan S NDE 6640",
  "date": "April 5, 1957",
  "content": "After giving birth to my son, I was taken to a room where I passed out because I was bleeding very badly. My spirit rose from my body and I looked down and watched the medical personnel working on me to revive me. I moved to a wonderful place where I was fully aware of anything and everything in the world. The joy I felt was wonderful. There was a tunnel with a beautiful light at the end it. I went toward the light and discovered a beautiful landscape with extraordinary plants and trees. I was so happy! I stopped to consider what would happen if I chose to stay in that place. How would my husband take care of this new baby and his three-year-old sister? He had just started a new business and didn't have time for family. I knew I needed to go back and take care of my children. So I did. I didn't see any humans there, or hear any sounds. I knew everything. I realized that if a God existed, he was within my spirit. Ever since that experience, I have been able to understand people even when they don't talk to me. I think my spirit communicates with their spirit. I enjoy my life on earth, but I also look forward to my afterlife.",
